# 6z7y 1.0.7_beta - 2026-04-17
Major changes:
- change files structure
- add tomutui & tomugui basic (not ready yet)
- refactor: reorganize src directory structure
  -- split server/ and clients/ into per-binary directories (tomu/, tomucli/, tomutui/, tomugui/)

* tomu:
  - rename audio_data.h to DATA.h
  - move args handling to args.c
  - refactor playback context
  - simplify main loop and poll logic
  - Fix audio pause delay with condition variable
  - improve status broadcast (only when state.running is true)
  - add metadata reading support (title, artist, album, etc.)
  - add embedded cover image extraction
  -- cover images saved to /tmp/tomu_cover_img/[filename].png

* tomucli:
  - move args handling to args.c
  - send client type before raw mode
  - improve init and cleanup order

